sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.314/2022 registered by Pulakeshinagara Police Station, Bengaluru City for the offences punishable under Sections 498(A), 304(B) R/w Sections 3, 4 & 6 of Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961,
subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/-
(Rupees One lakhs only) with one surety for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
 c) The petitioner shall not directly or  indirectly threaten or tamper with the  prosecution witnesses;

